<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were</p>
<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Monday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Osogovo		  phosphate	dsg	  8.930</p>
<p> - Odin 1		   urea	     ldg	 21,000</p>
<p> - Ocean Grace	    sugar	    dsg	 18,750</p>
<p> - Standard Virtue	soy beans	dsg	 36,500</p>
<p> - Qilianshan	     rolled metal   ldg	 14,500</p>
<p> - Topaz		    iron ore	 dsg	144,903</p>
<p> - Leopardi		 iron ore	 dsg	128,626</p>
<p> - Ionian King	    cement	   ldg	 28,500</p>
<p> - Darya Ma		 rolled metal   ldg	 16,500</p>
<p>				metal sheet    ldg	 11,000</p>
<p> - Uricani		  cement	   ldg	 12,000</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
